        "TileImage": "$($repository 88e277b3-9bf8-4032-9985-113dec131436).Image",
        "Description": "47,\r\r&quot;The Thrashers,&quot; as they&apos;re called, are &quot;pissed off&quot; that they can no longer have rehearsals in their basement. They have requested that we, as loudly as possible, take out the two armed guards lazily dawdling around the house.  This works out great for us, however, as Janus is quite &quot;well connected&quot; with the band. Give him a fitting end, won&apos;t you? \r\rREQUIREMENT: Use the Bartoli Woodsman Hunting Rifle to eliminate Hollis Mack &amp; Bobby Ashcroft.",
